msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"(...Hey, what about her? As far as being a hostess goes, she\r\n"
"might be a good fit. Let's see here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"(She doesn't seem like a talker, and I doubt she knows all\r\n"
"that much about the world... But I can tell she's very\r\n"
"diligent. Maybe I should approach her?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "(On second thought... maybe not.)"
msgstr "(Ripensandoci... Magari no.)"

msgctxt "184"
msgid "(Okay, let's see what I can come up with...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Hello there."
msgstr "Salve!"

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Huh? What? Oh, were you talking to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Sorry if this is coming out of nowhere, but I find you\r\n"
"absolutely fascinating. Could I have a moment of your time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Hehe. You may. What do you want to talk about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I'd like to introduce you to a job I think is perfect for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Oh, are you a recruiter? For one of those cabaret clubs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Yeah, I am, at a club over on Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"That does sound somewhat appealing... I mean, I could always\r\n"
"use the work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Well? What are we waiting for? Show me this club of yours!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "With pleasure. Oh, and the name's Kiryu... Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"All right then, Kazuma Kiryu. You can call me Jo! I'm 21, I\r\n"
"love to garden, aaand I'm licensed in CPR! Anyway, that's\r\n"
"me in a nutshell! Take it or leave it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Approach Her"
msgstr ""

